window.products.push({"id":368052,"name":"Chantal 5-inch Classic Individual Pie Dishes, White, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516B0ntAs-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Make your sweetie’s day with a petite pot pie or berry tart, just for him or her. Or keep it for yourself – we won’t tell! Our 5” classic individual pie dish keeps pace with the most creative cooks. Chantal’s exceptionally strong, non-porous glaze won’t react with foods or flavors. You can slice and serve directly from this dish, without worrying about scratches. Crafted to ensure excellent heat distribution, our pie dish promotes even baking. We hand-sand the base for a smooth, no-scratch surface. It cleans easily in the dishwasher and is microwave, oven and freezer safe. 1½ cup capacity. All Chantal ceramics are lead and cadmium safe and meet FDA and CA Prop 65 requirements. Amazon.com A scaled down version of the full-size original, these Chantal mini pie plates are versatile pieces of bakeware--and an adorable addition to the table. Measuring 5 inches in diameter, each dish has all the functionality of a larger pie plate, but their size is more suited to individual quiches or blackberry pie for two. Crafted from premium stoneware, the plates features thick walls for uniform and lasting heat retention. The fluted rim adds to presentation while making handling easier, and the non-reactive glazing retains its vivid color and glossy finish. Free of lead and cadmium, the plates are safe in the freezer, oven, and microwave, making it a kitchen-to-table piece. They clean up in the dishwasher and carry a 1-year warranty against cracking, crazing, and fading. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516B0ntAs-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chantal","source_asin":"B0012VMUKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012VMUKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012VMUKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
