window.products.push({"id":368066,"name":"Pendleton Chief Joseph Jacquard Bath Towel, Turquoise/Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MN4kV4yCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of our oldest blanket patterns brings history and Native American style to baths from ranch house to urban loft. The time-honored design was created in the 1920s to celebrate the heroism of the Northwest's great Nez Perce leader, Chief Joseph. Arrowheads symbolizing his bravery point in all directions of Mother Earth. 100-Percent cotton. Machine wash. Imported. 600 GSM. Must be ordered in quantities of three.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MN4kV4yCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pendleton","source_asin":"B00CO8V2I0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CO8V2I0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CO8V2I0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":368067,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Stick Vacuum with 30Kpa 450W Powerful Suction, Rechargeable Battery Vacuum Up to 60mins Runtime, 6-in-1 Lightweight Vacu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VWC3GC1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[450W 30Kpa Powerful Suction] Cordless vacuum cleaner features a 150AW advanced brushless motor that generates 30Kpa of powerful suction power in Max mode. A super hurricane suction is created by the high-speed drive of the motor, which can easily suck up large particles such as dog food, cat litter, debris, dust, and hair! As well as marble, tile, hardwood floors, stairs, and cars, the battery cordless vacuum performs well on carpets. A great cleaning experience awaits you with its super suction! [60 Mins Long Runtime & Lightweight Design] With the large capacity, detachable & rechargeable 7x2500mAh battery, the cordless stick vacuum cleaner gives you up to 60 minutes of deep cleaning in standard mode. There are 3 suction modes on this pet hair vacuum to meet your daily cleaning needs! A lightweight vacuum cleaner only weighs 9lbs, so it is perfect for one-handed cleaning. Regularly cleaning the HEPA filter will prevent weak suction and blockage. We offer a 12-month 100% satisfaction after-sales service for this rechargeable floor vacuum! [LED Smart Display & One-Button Empty] The rechargeable cordless stick vacuum features a LED screen display, a suction control button, three suction & battery indicators, battery level, full dustbin & tangled roller alerts, this machine makes cleaning more accessible and more intelligent! The carpet stick vacuum adjusts suction modes at will by controlling the speed button on the led screen. No dirt needs to be touched during emptying because of the one-click dust-dumping design. [Flexible Led Floor Brush] The vacuum cleaner cordless floor brush with LED Lights can easily clean the dust under furniture or in hard-to-reach corners. The V-shaped roller brush of the powerful stick vacuum with an anti-tangle design to avoid hair tangling. The unique V-shaped design makes the messes focus on the suction port to be wholly sucked up, which improves the cleaning effect. With a cordless handheld vacuum cleaner, you can swivel 180° sideways and 90° up and down to clean the whole house! [5-stages High-efficiency Filtration System] The pet hair vacuum cleaner with a fully-sealed system can extend the machine's life. Multi-stage filters combine to capture 99.99% of particle dust as small as 0.1um, providing ultimate purified air for your family and preventing secondary pollution. A high-efficiency cyclonic cone can reduce the HEPA filter cleaning times, and provide 2x filtering performance than the common filtration system. Note: HEPA is unwashable, attached is an extra HEPA. [One-Line Cyclone Path] Compared with other cordless stick vacuum cleaner cyclone paths, INSE V120 cordless vacuum cleaners always keep powerful & high-efficient suction. There is no attenuation of suction power and it is brushed directly from the floor to the air outlet. Home cleaning is easy with ergonomic handles. For your family or friends who have pets or naughty kids, this lightweight wireless vacuum would be the perfect gift. [Multi-purpose & Easy to Use] The rechargeable battery vacuum is equipped with different attachments and provides ideal cleaning for virtually any scenario. It can switch to cordless handheld vacuums easily to clean sofas, cars, keyboards, and corners. Also, it can connect with a metal tube to clean high places or ceilings. With the Easy Rest design, you can safely prop up the vacuum against countertops and furniture. Your cleaning will become labor-saving and hassle-free with INSE cordless vacuum!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VWC3GC1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B09Y5D4SNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5D4SNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5D4SNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
