window.products.push({"id":368141,"name":"Mealprep Silicone Garlic Peeler Skin Remover Roller Tube Upgraded Inner Bumps Professional Garlic Press Prep 2pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bAGl1DFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inner Bumps Texture Upgraded Design: Full of small round bumps in the silicone garlic peeler tube increases the friction which helps garlic peeling cleanly, quickly and completely. Inside ridges with no gap roller speeds up and simplifies the peeling of garlic without damaging the kernels. It is a great gadget for your kitchen life. Must Have Kitchen Utensil: Garlic peeler is an inexpensive tool that efficiently removes the garlic skin. No more tiny cutting, no more sticky smelly fingers, no more smashing with a knife or shaking in a jar works, no more consuming and messy. It's good idea in many recipes and dishes, anyone who love garlic cooking in the kitchen need to get one. Easy to Use: Separate the cloves, place one or few cloves into the tube, press down on it firmly with the palm of your hand, but don't crush them too hard, and briskly roll the tube back and forth against the counter for a couple of seconds, then garlic pops out and the skins comes off of the insides. 1.38inch large enough to put few cloves in, it's very good for fresh garlic, do one clove at a time for best results. Easy to Clean and Store: After use, just roll the cylinder against itself with soap, rinse with water in the sink or put into dishwasher for quick clean up and let it air dry. 3 pieces in case it is not cleaned before you need it again. Bottom hole design, convenient to hang up. Premium Material: Food grade silicone press rollers, flexible, odorless, lightweight and easy to use in the kitchen, it makes peeling garlic so much easier and quicker. 0.85oz weight to make sure the quality better and can be used for a long time. If you have any questions be free to let us know, you will get solutions within 24hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bAGl1DFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MealPrep","source_asin":"B08QJB73ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QJB73ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QJB73ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
