window.products.push({"id":368208,"name":"Elingmor Handheld Fan with Aromatherapy,Small Cooling USB Rechargeable Personal Turbo Fan,Quiet Mini Portable Hand Fan,3 Speeds Battery Operated Fan a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UpAQSsfhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Strong winds & Patented Turbocharged Airflow】 Elingmor Handheld Turbo Fan hold several patents for eddy current technology.The turbo gather wind design allows the airflow to be compressed with accelerated speed within the air duct. the wind is stronger and cools faster. 【Aromatherapy Design】Aromatherapy Cotton can be replaced, adding your favorite perfume flavor, relying on magnetic adsorption in the air outlet, through the personal fan to bring you a comfortable feeling. Using the principle of leverage can be easily opened and replaced, magnetism is used to prevent damage by dropping. 【3 Speeds & Quiet Operation】Using a DC brushless motor, there are 3 speeds for you to choose from, will definitely meet your demand in different occasions.First level wind speed operation is no louder than 25 decibels - so quiet you can hear yourself breathe. Third level wind speed create a slight white noise to help fall asleep faster. 【Handheld/Desktop Fan and Mini Size】Elingmor mini portable fan have Anti-slip texture ，can be used as a handheld fan when outdoor and used as a mini desktop fan on a flat table when in the office. Small and easy to slide into your pocket and Satchel.The Seashells design of the base can be tilted to place the fan, the wind angle is more suitable for Desktop use. 【Safety and One Year Warranty】The Fan blade hidden appearance, keep you and your family safe. We believe in our products thus we offer 12 month worry-free warranty, it covers material and workmanship defects for one year from the original purchase date. If you have any problems with this small personal fan, please contact us first, we will solve it for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UpAQSsfhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elingmor","source_asin":"B0B5395TX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5395TX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5395TX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
