window.products.push({"id":368232,"name":"10000 Clip on Fan, Small Desk Stroller Fan Battery Operated with Rechargeable USB & Hook, 3 Speed-4 Mode-6 Inch-360 Rotation Portable Quiet for Baby, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2cXEkaqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔋【10000 BATTERY & USB CABLE】 The rechargeable fan can be powered by USB cable or battery(both included). The built-in 10000 battery can last for 24-36 hours (depend on its speed) and is fully charged within 12 hours. It can also be charged via the computer, laptop, power bank, car adapter. You can charge while using it. 💨【4 POWERFUL WIND & SUPER QUIET】 The battery-operated fan comes with 4 speeds for different purposes, powerful wind yet whispers working. The 3-speed setting and 1 energy-saving setting give you exactly the wind you want. The fourth speed is the usb fan goes from 1-2-3 speed circularly. You can adjust wind speed by pressing the power button repeatedly. Moreover, running lower than 40db, this clip fan won't disturb your work and sound sleep. 💦【EASY TO CLEAＮ & CARRY】 With a removable cover, the personal fan can keep clean and last for a long time if you wash the cover and wipe dust timely. The small fan of 4.8*5*6 inch is lightweight and handy, which can be placed, clipped, or wall-mounted anywhere while saving a lot of space. We upgrade the material to be long-lasting, especially the tripod and battery. 🎁【360° ROTATION & BABY-FRIENDLY】 The portable fan supports 360° vertical and horizontal adjustment, keeping you cool from any angle. An ideal choice for people who are sensitive to air conditioning, such as babies, the elderly, and pregnant women. The unique feature of this stroller fan is its narrow slit cover design. You can hang it anywhere without worrying about hurting your baby's hands. A perfect gift for mothers. ✔【3-IN-1 DESIGN & EXTRA HOOK】 The mini fan can be used as a clip-on fan, a desk fan, or a camping fan with a hook, bringing you the greatest convenience. Equipped with a firm 2.5in clamp and soft rubber, you can easily place or clip this usb desk fan wherever you want without scratching the surface. It is very suitable for strollers, offices, libraries, gyms, camping, traveling, and other activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2cXEkaqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ezire","source_asin":"B072MRP179","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MRP179","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MRP179","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
