window.products.push({"id":368754,"name":"Bad Bananas Retirement Gifts For Men and Women - Good Mood - 16 oz Beer Pint Glass with Genuine 10K Gold Ink - Funny Happy Retirement Gift Ideas for R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gstxlfsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXQUISITE GIFT FOR THE RETIRED: Delight a retiring friend, coworker, boss, or relative to this funny retirement beer glass with the snarky statement \"Today's Good Mood Is Sponsored By Retirement and Beer.\" It's the perfect sentiment to wish your retired loved ones a happy and fruitful retirement. This glass is also a great female retirement gift, retired gift for men, a humorous retirement gift, or just a general gift for the retired in 2021. 10K GOLD INK: This beer glass is printed with true precious metal 10 Karat Gold Ink! It is not a foil, nor a decal, but genuine precious metals. To keep the glassware in tip-top shape, hand-wash only and do not microwave. The retired love ones in your life will surely appreciate this durable retirement beer glass gift that can last them for a long time. BEER GLASS CAPACITY: This beer pint multipurpose drinking glass holds a generous 16 ounces and is suitable for hot or cold drinks or even scoops of ice cream and other snacks. It is decorated with 10K metallic gold ink, and its production has undergone strict quality control to ensure that its suitable for long-term use. Our precision-decorated glass is durable, weighty, and built to last through years of use. QUALITY RETIREMENT GIFT FOR MEN 2021: Our novelty gift beer glasses for retired men and women are decorated in a family-owned workshop. Each glass is individually inspected and expertly packed to ensure your special beer gift arrives in excellent condition. We are proud to offer you a gift that is sure to delight the retiring friend or relative you are buying this for. One that they can treasure for a lifetime. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you are not fully satisfied with our men's retirement gifts, we offer a money-back guarantee so that you can buy these unique gift retirement ideas or farewell gifts with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gstxlfsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bad Bananas","source_asin":"B09BBGLL67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BBGLL67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BBGLL67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
