window.products.push({"id":368994,"name":"Corelle Livingware 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Geometric, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nv-Fq8yTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Corelle Livingware Urban Black 16-piece set, service for 4 includes 4-each-10-1/4-inch dinner plates, 4-each-6-3/4-inch bread and butter plates, 4-each-18-ounce soup/cereal bowls, 4-each-11-ounce stoneware stoneware mugs. The striking contrast of bold, black bands on white dinnerware and matching solid stoneware mugs offers a contemporary look that's simple, yet elegant and coordinates with a range of home décor styles.Corelle, brings beauty and durability to your table everyday. For more than three decades, Corelle products have epitomized the definition of durability and quality. What makes Corelle Livingware and Corelle Ultra so durable and versatile is vitrelle brand glass, composed of a unique, technologically advanced material. In a one of a kind manufacturing facility in Corning, New York, Corelle thermally bonds three layers of glass together, forms the shapes and then tempers the glass to give its final strength. Because of this process, Corelle Livingware and Corelle Ultra dinnerware have the added versatility of being suitable for reheating or even cooking in conventional, convection or microwave ovens. And with their ergonomic, lightweight design, Livingware and Ultra plates and bowls stack easily, conserving valuable kitchen space. In addition to its exceptional durability and design, Corelle products offer an array of fashionable patterns and coordinates - perfect for all kitchen decorating styles. Corelle's beautiful patterns also withstand the test of time. That's because Corelle use only food safe enamel pigments that are fired directly onto the dinnerware. You'll never need to worry about fading, scraping, scratching, or wearing off. Corelle… beautiful today¿.. Beautiful for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nv-Fq8yTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B0007XXS8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007XXS8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007XXS8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":368995,"name":"Signature Design by Ashley Lacey Traditional Faux Marble Dining Table, Medium Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-M9xalaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"The rich contemporary design of the \"Lacey\" dining room collection features faux marble and a subtle rustic beauty to create a sophisticated atmosphere that is sure to enhance any dining experience. The thick profiled faux marble table top is covered with a clear polyurethane finish and is supported by the straight-lined contemporary legs bathed in a dark brown finish. The brown PVC upholstered chairs feature stylish stitching and a button tufting to further enhance the contemporary design of this dining collection. Create a sophisticated style for your dining room decor with the inviting feel of the \"Lacey\" dining room collection.El rico diseño contemporáneo de la colección de comedor \"Lacey\" cuenta con mármol sintético y una sutil belleza rústica para crear un ambiente sofisticado que seguramente mejorará cualquier experiencia gastronómica. La parte superior de la mesa de mármol sintético de perfil grueso está cubierta con un acabado de poliuretano transparente y está apoyada por las patas contemporáneas rectas bañadas en un acabado marrón oscuro. Las sillas tapizadas de PVC marrón cuentan con costuras elegantes y un toque de botón para mejorar aún más el diseño contemporáneo de esta colección de comedores. Crea un estilo sofisticado para la decoración de tu comedor con la sensación acogedora de la colección de comedor \"Lacey\".Das reichhaltige, moderne Design der Esszimmerkollektion \"Lacey\" verfügt über Kunstmarmor und eine subtile rustikale Schönheit, um eine anspruchsvolle Atmosphäre zu schaffen, die sicher jedes kulinarische Erlebnis bereichert. Die dicke, profilierte Kunstmarmor-Tischplatte ist mit einem klaren Polyurethan-Finish überzogen und wird durch die geraden und modernen Beine in einem dunkelbraunen Finish unterstützt. Die braunen PVC-gepolsterten Stühle verfügen über stilvolle Nähte und eine Knopftung, um das moderne Design dieser Esszimmer-Kollektion noch weiter zu verbessern. Schaffen Sie einen anspruchsvollen Stil für Ihre Esszimmer-Dekoration mit dem einladenden Gefühl der \"Lacey\"-Esszimmerkollektion.O design contemporneo rico da coleço de sala de jantar \"Lacey\" apresenta mármore sintético e uma beleza rústica sutil para criar uma atmosfera sofisticada que certamente irá melhorar qualquer experiência de jantar. O tampo de mesa grosso de mármore sintético é coberto com um acabamento de poliuretano transparente e é apoiado pelas pernas contemporneas alinhadas banhadas em um acabamento marrom escuro. As cadeiras estofadas de PVC marrom apresentam costura elegante e um boto tufante para melhorar ainda mais o design contemporneo desta coleço de jantares. Crie um estilo sofisticado para a decoraço da sua sala de jantar com a sensaço convidativa da coleço da sala de jantar \"Lacey\".「Lacey餐廳系列的豐富現代設計,採用人造大理石和微妙的質樸美,營造出精緻的氛圍,確保提升任何用餐體驗 厚實外形的人造大理石桌面採用透明聚氨酯飾面,並以深褐色表面注入直筒的現代桌腿支撐 棕色 PVC 軟墊椅採用時尚的拼接和一個鈕釦簇絨,進一步提升了這個餐廳系列的當代設計 以「Lacey餐廳系列的迷人感覺,為您的餐廳裝飾打造精緻風格\"Lacey\"餐厅系列丰富的现代设计采用人造大理石和微妙的乡村美感,营造出精致的氛围,一定会增强任何用餐体验 厚型人造大理石桌面表面覆盖透明聚氨酯表面,并由直线条现代支腿深棕色饰面支撑 棕色PVC软垫椅采用时尚的缝线和纽扣簇绒，进一步提升了这款餐厅系列的现代设计 将 \"Lacey\" 餐厅系列中的诱人感觉,打造精致风格\"Lacey\" 다이닝 룸 컬렉션의 풍부하고 현대적인 디자인은 인조 대리석과 미묘한 소박한 아름다움을 특징으로 하며 세련된 분위기를 만들어 모든 식사 경험을 향상시킵니다. 두꺼운 인조 대리석 테이블 상단은 투명한 폴리우레탄 마감으로 덮여 있으며 다크 브라운 마감으로 목욕된 스트레이트 라인 현대적인 다리가 지지됩니다. 브라운 PVC 덮개 의자는 세련된 스티칭과 버튼 터프팅으로 이 다이닝 컬렉션의 현대적인 디자인을 더욱 향상시킵니다. \"Lacey\" 다이닝 룸 컬렉션의 매력적인 느낌으로 다이닝 룸 장식에 세련된 스타일을 만들어보세요.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-M9xalaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B002YREJ7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-368995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002YREJ7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002YREJ7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
